=== fresh-clone reproduction ===
Method: copied the pack directory to a fresh location (/tmp/fresh-clone-repro),
ran `bash scripts/run_all.sh` there with no other change, then compared the
fresh copy against the pack with `diff -r --exclude=run_all.log`.
Result: exit 0 in the fresh copy; 35/35 digests verify (`bash
scripts/verify_digests.sh`); `diff -r` identical; SHA256SUMS identical;
run-manifest.json identical.
Excluded from comparison: outputs/run_all.log (carries a wall-clock start
line; excluded from SHA256SUMS by design).
Note: the first reproduction attempt found two determinism defects, both
fixed in the pack before this log was written: (1) outputs/parse-*.json
embedded the absolute checkout path in "log_path" — now recorded relative
to the pack root; (2) running the Python scripts created
scripts/__pycache__/*.pyc with embedded timestamps — run_all.sh now sets
PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 and the cache directory is not part of the pack.
This log is the record of the successful second reproduction.
